.TH NN-CONVERT 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-convert \- conversion frontend
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn convert [options] <input>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Adapter-based conversion. Currently IR to ONNX is available; other routes report unavailable.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-to FORMAT
Destination format.
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output FILE
Output path.
.TP
.B \-\-list
List conversion routes.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 7 conversion unavailable.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn convert --list
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-formats(1), nn-optimize(1)
